      "type": "subsubheader",
      "html": "<strong>Hebrew::</strong>",
      "anchorId": "hebrew"
    },
    {
      "id": "ccfd895d-7ce4-4ced-88eb-4312656feda5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://biblehub.com/hebrew/5953c.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><strong>alal</strong></a><strong>: </strong><em>to act or play the child— children</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "7a5bb8e5-dbca-422c-a199-d580c836a7da",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://biblehub.com/hebrew/7832.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><strong>sachaq</strong></a><strong>: </strong><em>to laugh, to play— amuse, celebrate, hold a contest, merrymakers, deride, have in derision, laugh, make merry, mock(-er), play, rejoice, (laugh to) scorn, be in (make) sport</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "474d5caa-cc8b-4ae5-bc8b-c8bce67fe4cf",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://biblehub.com/hebrew/6711.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><strong>tsachaq</strong></a><strong>: </strong><em>to laugh— caressing, entertained, jesting, to laugh outright (in merriment or scorn); by implication, to sport, laugh, mock, play, make sport</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "118e66b8-6c22-4bd3-8ed6-b75377dc3bd2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<a href=\"https://biblehub.com/hebrew/8173.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><strong>sha'a'</strong></a><strong>: </strong><em>stare, to be smeared over— blinded, to look upon (with complacency), i.e. fondle, please or amuse (self); (in a bad one) to look about (in dismay), i.e. Stare -- cry (out) (by confusion with shava'), dandle, delight (self), play, shut</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "2df8f538-d59c-430b-9c5c-730bcb7af3be",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1f5e0d8a-9a93-4b4f-a6eb-419362e18eb5",
